msgid "Babilim"
msgstr "Babilim"

#. Description of the plugin
#: babilim.php
msgid "Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site."
msgstr "Lìonaidh e na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a tha a dhìth airson na plugain agus na cuspairean a tha stàlaichte mu thràth air an làrach agad."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1274
msgid "That upload screen was out of date: a different upload has been prepared since. Nothing was sent. Review the current one from the Translations list."
msgstr "Bha an sgrìn luchdaidh suas sin air a dhol à ceann-ùine: chaidh luchdadh suas eile ullachadh bhon uair sin. Cha deach dad a chur. Thoir sùil air an fhear làithreach on liosta de eadar-theangachaidhean."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3067
msgid "The free service plan gives each site a limited number of slots for plugins and themes; the slots in use are shown in Settings after you enable Babilim."
msgstr "Tha am plana seirbheis an-asgaidh a’ toirt àireamh chuingealaichte de shlotan do gach làrach airson plugain agus cuspairean; tha na slotan a tha ’gan cleachdadh ri fhaicinn ann an Settings às dèidh dhut Babilim a chur an comas."

#. translators: 1: the free service plan's theme slot limit, 2: its plugin slot limit (both numbers come from the service).
#: admin/class-babilim-translations-table.php:62
#, php-format
msgid "Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan's slots for this site (the limit is %1$d for themes and %2$d for plugins), unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it."
msgstr "Ma dh’iarras tu eadar-theangachadh, thèid am plugan no an cuspair seo a chur air aon de shlotan a’ phlana seirbheis an-asgaidh airson na làraich seo (is e %1$d a’ chrìoch airson cuspairean agus %2$d airson plugain), mura h-eil fear aige mu thràth. Aon uair ’s gun deach slot a chleachdadh, fanaidh e ’na shlot ann an cleachdadh, agus cha dèan eadar-theangachadh a dh’fhàillig slot a shaoradh."

#: admin/class-babilim-translations-table.php:67
msgid "Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan's slots for this site, unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it."
msgstr "Ma dh’iarras tu eadar-theangachadh, thèid am plugan no an cuspair seo a chur air aon de shlotan a’ phlana seirbheis an-asgaidh airson na làraich seo, mura h-eil fear aige mu thràth. Aon uair ’s gun deach slot a chleachdadh, fanaidh e ’na shlot ann an cleachdadh, agus cha dèan eadar-theangachadh a dh’fhàillig slot a shaoradh."

#. translators: 1: the free service plan's theme slot limit, 2: its plugin slot limit (both numbers come from the service).
#: admin/class-babilim-translations-table.php:80
#, php-format
msgid "If this plugin or theme is not on one of the free service plan's slots for this site yet, requesting a translation puts it on one (the limit is %1$d for themes and %2$d for plugins). A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it. Continue?"
msgstr "Mura h-eil am plugan no an cuspair seo air aon de shlotan a’ phlana seirbheis an-asgaidh airson na làraich seo fhathast, thèid a chur air fear ma dh’iarras tu eadar-theangachadh (is e %1$d a’ chrìoch airson cuspairean agus %2$d airson plugain). Aon uair ’s gun deach slot a chleachdadh, fanaidh e ’na shlot ann an cleachdadh, agus cha dèan eadar-theangachadh a dh’fhàillig slot a shaoradh. A bheil thu airson leantainn air adhart?"

#: admin/class-babilim-translations-table.php:85
msgid "If this plugin or theme is not on one of the free service plan's slots for this site yet, requesting a translation puts it on one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it. Continue?"
msgstr "Mura h-eil am plugan no an cuspair seo air aon de shlotan a’ phlana seirbheis an-asgaidh airson na làraich seo fhathast, thèid a chur air fear ma dh’iarras tu eadar-theangachadh. Aon uair ’s gun deach slot a chleachdadh, fanaidh e ’na shlot ann an cleachdadh, agus cha dèan eadar-theangachadh a dh’fhàillig slot a shaoradh. A bheil thu airson leantainn air adhart?"

#. translators: 1: number of sites on the network that erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. 2: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1974
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in that site's Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgid_plural "%1$d sites on this network are set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to those sites could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in each site's Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr[0] "Tha %1$d làrach air an lìonra seo air a suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aice a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris an làrach sin aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %2$s. Gus an dearbh-aithne a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim na làraich sin, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"
msgstr[1] "Tha %1$d làrach air an lìonra seo air an suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aca a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris na làraichean sin aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %2$s. Gus na dearbh-aithnean a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim gach làraich, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"
msgstr[2] "Tha %1$d làrach air an lìonra seo air an suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aca a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris na làraichean sin aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %2$s. Gus na dearbh-aithnean a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim gach làraich, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"
msgstr[3] "Tha %1$d làrach air an lìonra seo air an suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aca a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris na làraichean sin aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %2$s. Gus na dearbh-aithnean a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim gach làraich, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"

