#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3881
msgid "When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default."
msgstr "Nuair a dh'fhailicheas rudeigin am broinn Babilim, cuir aithisg mhearachd gu Seirbheis Babilim airson a foillseachadh mar cheist phoblach air GitHub. Thèid an aithisg a chur às leth na làraich seo, leis an dearbhadh co-ionnan ris a h-uile iarrtas eile gu Seirbheis Babilim. Chan fhoillsich an t-seirbheis ach còd na mearachd agus na tionndaidhean mar cheist phoblach air GitHub; chan eil seòladh làraich, susbaint no slighean fhaidhlichean sa cheist phoblach. Dheth a ghnàth."

